{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/xrq_LlNTObS42PCVT_cy0g","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:54:52.380513+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/xrq_LlNTObS42PCVT_cy0g","html":"<div><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/VMjT265rUiahwLmEfFPtazjl4pllE2ia6Y4PibMeQ4D3VzkSKicsKLR9PywNhzOW2OibUGltoSicXauD5ibmTcvsAhILvUWkr48mkGaxHScm0t2qVg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>为做好2027年推荐免试研究生（含直博生）招生工作，根据教育部相关文件和《长安大学2027年推荐免试研究生（含直博生）招生简章》的规定及要求，特制定本实施细则。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>01</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>招生专业</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>学科专业代码 专业名称</span></p><p><strong><span><span>学术型</span></span></strong><span><span>：081400土木工程（岩土工程，防灾减灾工程及防护工程，结构工程，土木工程建造与管理，市政工程，供热、供燃气、通风及空调工程）；</span></span></p><p><strong><span>专业型</span></strong><span>：085900 土木水利</span></p><p><span>085901土木工程（岩土工程、结构工程、防灾减灾工程及防护工程）；</span></p><p><span>085905市政工程（含给排水等）；</span></p><p><span>085906人工环境工程（含供热、通风及空调等）</span></p><p><strong><span>以上专业均接收硕士研究生及直博生申请。</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>02</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请条件</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>1.拥护中国共产党的领导，遵纪守法，品德良好；</span></span></p><p><span><span>2.2027届普通全日制本科毕业生，取得本科所在学校的推荐免试生资格；</span></span></p><p><span><span>3.研究兴趣浓厚，有较强的创新意识、创新能力和专业能力；</span></span></p><p><span><span>4.身体健康状况符合国家规定的体检要求。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>03</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请程序</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>（一）预报名</span></strong></p><p><span>2026年9月15日前，凡有意报考我院2027年推荐免试研究生的申请人登录长安大学推免生预报名系统（https://yzfw.chd.edu.cn:9091/xly/），填写有关信息、上传附件材料并提交申请，申请材料见《长安大学2027年接收推荐免试研究生（含直博生）预报名通知》（https://yzb.chd.edu.cn/2026/0723/c2769a262101/page.htm）。</span></p><p><span>有意向申请我院2027年推免研究生的同学请加入QQ群：长大土木学院2026年预推免群</span><span><span>（群号193915677）</span></span><span>，申请入群请备注信息: 姓名+本科学校。其他后续工作安排将在群中通知。</span></p><p><span>拟申请直博生的同学须提交两份专家推荐书（模板见附件）</span></p><p><span>错过预报名时间的申请人如仍有意愿报考我院，可在正式报名阶段直接在“全国推荐免试攻读研究生（免初试、转段）信息公开管理服务系统”（以下简称“全国推免服务系统”）中报名。</span></p><p><strong><span>（二）正式报名</span></strong></p><p><span>获得推免生资格的申请人在全国推免服务系统（网址：https://yz.chsi.com.cn/tm）开通后报名。</span></p><p><strong><span>（三）材料审核</span></strong></p><p><span>学院成立若干推免材料审核小组，对考生申请材料进行初审后，通知通过初审的考生参加复试。</span></p><p><strong><span>（四）面试考核</span></strong></p><p><span>学院成立面试专家组对申请人进行面试考核。面试考核内容：思想政治素质和品德考核（考核不通过者不予录取）；外国语水平；专业知识、科研能力、综合素质等。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>04</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>拟录取</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>1.学院按照“择优录取、保证质量、宁缺毋滥”的原则，根据考核成绩，综合考生思想政治表现、身心健康状况等，在各专业接收推免生计划限额内择优拟录取。</span></p><p><span>2.学院通过全国推免服务系统向考生发送待录取通知，通知考生进行确认。考生收到待录取通知后，按照学院规定时间在全国推免服务系统确认或拒绝待录取。逾期未确认的考生，视为自动放弃拟录取资格。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>05</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>联系方式</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>联系人：张老师</span></p><p><span>地  址：长安大学渭水校区致远大厦E611室</span></p><p><span>电  话：029-82337305</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>06</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>其他事项</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>1.申请人须保证全部申请材料的真实性和准确性，若经查实存在学术不端或申报材料弄虚作假情形，均按相关规定取消拟录取或录取资格。</span></span></p><p><span><span>2.学校将对新生入学资格进行复查，推免生如在录取当年入学时未取得国家承认的本科毕业证书，录取资格无效。</span></span></p><p><span><span>3.根据教育部政策规定，取得录取资格的推免生不得再报名参加当年硕士研究生招生考试。</span></span></p><p><span><span>4.其他未尽事宜，按照长安大学研究生招生相关文件及学院补充通知执行。</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/6LiaEAplUaanFeS6TE1DdZGZuJWyRJuLXmwkx4xxU6WHqefM9gibnBteEWaycUKDHsDasxM6nNJZfTtoql8wxHQg/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>土木研会</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>图文来源 | 长安大学土木工程</span></span></p><p><span><span>与智能建造学院</span></span></p><p><span><span>编辑 | 钮文旭</span></span></p><p><span><span>初审 | 史欣欣  钮文旭</span></span></p><p><span><span>复审 | 闫   可</span></span></p><p><span><span>终审 | 马熠航</span></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/U8Vt95qrjzw28VlK3suKCq0FU0r6yxscHu5wLOj9b0nFwfjPn7Csb9hjuVtVsTyxPEAyTtUETah8AySkMheiar1gGAVDjVtE1Vvy68c6zwmU/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"972a50ccb14a396b53f03d3808785b25d3668c31a14fe2bb3de5d3fe0725da25","textLength":1445,"sourceSha256":"35b2ff6b915754b82725e73af3e3c46033894f22d790088c1878a84a22fa67d1","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-da3fca7aa3a9529902ed","title":"2026年长安大学土木工程与智能建造学院2027年推荐免试研究生（含直博生）招生工作细则","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:54:52.380513+00:00"}
